  - type: 0
    text: "An armored sentinel guards (1, 0) from 3 tiles away. Your Archer lacks the 2 SP required for Focused Aim, and your Warrior stands too far west to reach him in one stride."
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 0
    text: "When SP is scarce, Trinket Skills turn the tide - spending zero SP to reshape your reach!"
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 1
    text: Select your Archer at (-2, 0).
    tutorialTargetId: Unit1
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 15
  - type: 2
    text: Right-click the Trinket Skill slot (Far Sight!) to inspect its power.
    tutorialTargetId: TSKILL
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 0
    text: "Far Sight! is an Instant Trinket costing 0 SP - extending horizontal weapon reach by +1 tile for 10 Instants!"
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 6
    text: Left-click Far Sight! to arm it.
    tutorialTargetId: TSKILL
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
